<h2 class="wp-block-heading">The Christmas Mantel Formula</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A balanced Christmas mantel can be built in the same five layers, from the back to the front: an anchor on the wall, a garland on the mantel, tall pieces at the ends, small fillers in between and stockings below. Building in this order keeps the arrangement balanced and stops you from buying random pieces that do not fit together.</p>



